%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: db3913ed5f51e5045acd20091cb8bb5d, type: 3}
  m_Name: KH_TextTable
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KhoaHon.Core.TextTable
  entries:
  - key: prompt.open_door
    text: "[E] M\u1EDF c\u1EEDa"
    en: '[E] Open'
  - key: prompt.close_door
    text: "[E] \u0110\xF3ng c\u1EEDa"
    en: '[E] Close'
  - key: prompt.locked
    text: "C\u1EEDa b\u1ECB kh\xF3a"
    en: Locked
  - key: prompt.unlock_with
    text: "[E] M\u1EDF kh\xF3a b\u1EB1ng {0}"
    en: '[E] Unlock with {0}'
  - key: prompt.pickup
    text: "[E] Nh\u1EB7t {0}"
    en: '[E] Take {0}'
  - key: prompt.read
    text: "[E] \u0110\u1ECDc: {0}"
    en: '[E] Read: {0}'
  - key: prompt.inspect
    text: '[E] Xem'
    en: '[E] Examine'
  - key: prompt.main_door_locked
    text: "C\u1EEDa ch\xEDnh \u0111\xE3 s\u1EADp kh\xF3a. Kh\xF4ng m\u1EDF \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c."
    en: The front door has slammed shut. It won't budge.
  - key: prompt.stair_door_locked
    text: "C\u1EEDa l\xEAn t\u1EA7ng hai b\u1ECB kh\xF3a"
    en: The door to the upper floor is locked
  - key: prompt.chains
    text: "N\u1EAFp h\u1EA7m b\u1ECB kh\xF3a b\u1EB1ng 5 s\u1EE3i x\xEDch"
    en: The cellar hatch is bound by five chains
  - key: prompt.altar
    text: "B\xE0n th\u1EDD gia t\u1ED9c \u2014 13 bia t\u01B0\u1EDFng ni\u1EC7m,
      5 b\u1EC7 n\u1EBFn"
    en: "Family shrine \u2014 13 memorial plaques, 5 candle stands"
  - key: prompt.body
    text: '[E] Xem'
    en: '[E] Examine'
  - key: msg.chains
    text: "N\u0103m s\u1EE3i x\xEDch l\u1EDBn n\u1ED1i ng\u1EA7m v\xE0o t\u01B0\u1EDDng.
      Kh\xF4ng c\xF3 \u1ED5 kh\xF3a n\xE0o c\u1EA3."
    en: Five heavy chains run into the walls. There is no lock anywhere.
  - key: msg.altar
    text: "M\u01B0\u1EDDi ba t\u1EA5m bia t\u01B0\u1EDFng ni\u1EC7m. N\u0103m t\u1EA5m
      m\u1EA1 v\xE0ng, d\u01B0\u1EDBi m\u1ED7i t\u1EA5m l\xE0 m\u1ED9t b\u1EC7 n\u1EBFn
      tr\u1ED1ng."
    en: Thirteen memorial plaques. Five are gilded, each above an empty candle stand.
  - key: msg.rubble
    text: "\u0110\xE1 s\u1EADp k\xEDn m\u1ED9t \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng h\u1EA7m khoan
      h\u1EB9p. Kh\xF4ng \u0111i ti\u1EBFp \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c."
    en: Collapsed stone blocks a narrow drilled tunnel. No way through.
  - key: key.upstairs
    text: "ch\xECa kh\xF3a c\u1EEDa c\u1EA7u thang"
    en: the staircase key
  - key: item.backpack
    text: "balo c\u1EE7a Julian"
    en: Julian's backpack
  - key: item.battery
    text: pin
    en: batteries
  - key: item.film
    text: "cu\u1ED9n phim"
    en: a film roll
  - key: item.safe_placeholder
    text: "\u0111\u1ED3 trong k\xE9t s\u1EAFt"
    en: the safe's contents
  - key: item.tape
    text: "cu\u1ED9n b\u0103ng cassette"
    en: a cassette tape
  - key: item.newspaper
    text: "m\u1EA9u b\xE1o c\u0169"
    en: an old newspaper
  - key: item.relic_moc
    text: "b\xFAp b\xEA v\u1EA3i"
    en: the rag doll
  - key: item.relic_thuy
    text: "l\xE1 th\u01B0 c\u1EA7u c\u1EE9u"
    en: the unsent letter
  - key: item.relic_tho
    text: "l\u01B0\u1EE3c s\u1EEBng c\u1ED5"
    en: the horn comb
  - key: item.relic_kim
    text: "b\xFAa \u0111\xF3ng \u0111inh"
    en: the bloody hammer
  - key: item.relic_hoa
    text: "\u0111\xF4i gi\xE0y l\u1EE5a th\xEAu"
    en: the embroidered silk slippers
  - key: item.generic
    text: "v\u1EADt ph\u1EA9m"
    en: item
  - key: toast.got_item
    text: "\u0110\xE3 nh\u1EB7t: {0}"
    en: 'Picked up: {0}'
  - key: toast.notebook_added
    text: "\u0110\xE3 ghi v\xE0o S\u1ED5 tay: {0}"
    en: 'Added to notebook: {0}'
  - key: toast.saved
    text: "\u0110\xE3 l\u01B0u ti\u1EBFn tr\xECnh"
    en: Progress saved
  - key: toast.no_save
    text: "Ch\u01B0a c\xF3 b\u1EA3n l\u01B0u"
    en: No saved game
  - key: hint.backpack
    text: "Nghe cu\u1ED9n b\u0103ng b\u1EB1ng m\xE1y ghi \xE2m ho\u1EB7c \u0111i\u1EC7n
      tho\u1EA1i (Tab > B\u0103ng ghi \xE2m)"
    en: Play the tape on the recorder or phone (Tab > Tapes)
  - key: sub.front_door_slam
    text: "(C\u1EEDa ch\xEDnh s\u1EADp l\u1EA1i sau l\u01B0ng. Then c\xE0i r\u01A1i
      xu\u1ED1ng.)"
    en: (The front door slams behind you. The bolt drops.)
  - key: ui.close
    text: "\u0110\xF3ng [E]"
    en: 'Close [E]'
  - key: notebook.title
    text: "S\u1ED5 tay \u0111i\u1EC1u tra"
    en: Case Notebook
  - key: notebook.hint
    text: "Tab / J: \u0111\xF3ng  \xB7  Q / E: \u0111\u1ED5i tab"
    en: "Tab / J: close  \xB7  Q / E: switch tab"
  - key: notebook.tab.documents
    text: "T\xE0i li\u1EC7u"
    en: Documents
  - key: notebook.tab.tapes
    text: "B\u0103ng ghi \xE2m"
    en: Tapes
  - key: notebook.tab.photos
    text: "\u1EA2nh"
    en: Photos
  - key: notebook.tab.talismans
    text: Vademecum
    en: Vademecum
  - key: notebook.tab.relics
    text: "K\u1EF7 v\u1EADt"
    en: Relics
  - key: notebook.empty
    text: "Ch\u01B0a c\xF3 g\xEC."
    en: Nothing yet.
  - key: notebook.new
    text: "m\u1EDBi"
    en: new
  - key: notebook.tape_hint
    text: "[Space] Ph\xE1t b\u0103ng n\xE0y (v\u1EEBa \u0111i v\u1EEBa nghe \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c)."
    en: '[Space] Play this tape (you can keep walking).'
  - key: intro.1
    text: "Julian Vance m\u1EA5t t\xEDch \u1EDF dinh th\u1EF1 Blackwood \u0111\xE3
      m\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1ED1n ng\xE0y."
    en: Julian Vance has been missing inside Blackwood Manor for fourteen days.
  - key: intro.2
    text: "\u0110\xEAm cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng, c\u1EADu \u1EA5y g\u1EEDi v\u1EC1 m\u1ED9t
      b\u1EE9c \u1EA3nh ch\u1EE5p s\xE0n nh\xE0 b\u1EBFp. C\u1EA3nh s\xE1t n\xF3i
      \u0111\xF3 ch\u1EC9 l\xE0 v\u1EBFt b\u1EA9n."
    en: On his last night he sent a photo of the kitchen floor. The police called
      it a stain.
  - key: intro.3
    text: "T\xF4i kh\xF4ng tin."
    en: I don't believe them.
  - key: prompt.door_stuck
    text: "C\u1EEDa k\u1EB9t c\u1EE9ng, kh\xF4ng m\u1EDF \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c"
    en: The door is jammed shut
  - key: prompt.locked_outside
    text: "C\u1EEDa b\u1ECB kh\xF3a t\u1EEB b\xEAn ngo\xE0i"
    en: Locked from the other side
  - key: prompt.hide_wardrobe
    text: "[E] Tr\u1ED1n v\xE0o t\u1EE7"
    en: '[E] Hide in the wardrobe'
  - key: prompt.hide_bed
    text: "[E] Chui xu\u1ED1ng g\u1EA7m gi\u01B0\u1EDDng"
    en: '[E] Hide under the bed'
  - key: prompt.hide_exit
    text: "[E] Ra ngo\xE0i"
    en: '[E] Come out'
  - key: prompt.hold_breath
    text: "Gi\u1EEF [Space] \u0111\u1EC3 n\xEDn th\u1EDF!"
    en: Hold [Space] to hold your breath!
  - key: sub.hk_run
    text: "Ch\u1EA1y \u0111i\u2026"
    en: "Run\u2026"
  - key: sub.hk_comb
    text: "Ch\u1EA1y \u0111i\u2026 ta kh\xF4ng ki\u1EC1m ch\u1EBF \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c\u2026"
    en: "Run\u2026 I can't hold myself back\u2026"
  - key: sub.hk_lullaby
    text: "\u266A Ng\u1EE7 \u0111i con, n\u1EBFn \u0111\xE3 t\xE0n\u2026 c\u1EEDa
      \u0111\xE3 c\xE0i\u2026 B\xE0 Peake gi\u1EEF ch\xECa kh\xF3a, ch\u1EB3ng ai
      ra ngo\xE0i\u2026 \u266A"
    en: "\u266A Hush now, child, the candle's low\u2026 the doors are barred\u2026
      Mrs. Peake keeps the keys, and no one leaves at all\u2026 \u266A"
  - key: ui.title_top
    text: "L\u1EDCI NGUY\u1EC0N KH\xD3A H\u1ED2N"
    en: THE SOUL-LOCK CURSE
  - key: ui.title_main
    text: BLACKWOOD MANOR
    en: BLACKWOOD MANOR
  - key: ui.continue
    text: "Ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c"
    en: Continue
  - key: ui.new_game
    text: "Tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i m\u1EDBi"
    en: New Game
  - key: ui.settings
    text: "C\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t"
    en: Settings
  - key: ui.credits
    text: "Th\xF4ng tin"
    en: Credits
  - key: ui.quit
    text: "Tho\xE1t"
    en: Quit
  - key: ui.version
    text: "Blackwood Manor \xB7 phi\xEAn b\u1EA3n 0.5"
    en: "Blackwood Manor \xB7 build 0.5"
  - key: ui.menu_hint
    text: "N\xEAn \u0111eo tai nghe v\xE0 ch\u01A1i trong b\xF3ng t\u1ED1i."
    en: Best played with headphones, in the dark.
  - key: ui.confirm_new
    text: "B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u l\u1EA1i t\u1EEB \u0111\u1EA7u? Ti\u1EBFn tr\xECnh
      \u0111\xE3 l\u01B0u s\u1EBD b\u1ECB x\xF3a."
    en: Start over? Your saved progress will be lost.
  - key: ui.confirm_quit
    text: "Tho\xE1t game?"
    en: Quit the game?
  - key: ui.confirm_menu
    text: "V\u1EC1 menu ch\xEDnh? Ti\u1EBFn tr\xECnh t\u1EEB \u0111i\u1EC3m l\u01B0u
      g\u1EA7n nh\u1EA5t s\u1EBD m\u1EA5t."
    en: Return to the main menu? Progress since the last save will be lost.
  - key: ui.confirm_reload
    text: "T\u1EA3i l\u1EA1i \u0111i\u1EC3m l\u01B0u g\u1EA7n nh\u1EA5t?"
    en: Reload the last checkpoint?
  - key: ui.yes
    text: "\u0110\u1ED3ng \xFD"
    en: Yes
  - key: ui.no
    text: "H\u1EE7y"
    en: Cancel
  - key: ui.confirm
    text: "X\xE1c nh\u1EADn"
    en: Confirm
  - key: ui.back
    text: "Quay l\u1EA1i"
    en: Back
  - key: ui.apply
    text: "\xC1p d\u1EE5ng"
    en: Apply
  - key: ui.defaults
    text: "M\u1EB7c \u0111\u1ECBnh"
    en: Defaults
  - key: ui.applied
    text: "\u0110\xE3 \xE1p d\u1EE5ng c\xE0i \u0111\u1EB7t"
    en: Settings applied
  - key: ui.paused
    text: "T\u1EA0M D\u1EEANG"
    en: PAUSED
  - key: ui.resume
    text: "Ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c"
    en: Resume
  - key: ui.reload_checkpoint
    text: "T\u1EA3i l\u1EA1i \u0111i\u1EC3m l\u01B0u"
    en: Reload checkpoint
  - key: ui.main_menu
    text: "V\u1EC1 menu ch\xEDnh"
    en: Main menu
  - key: ui.pause_tip
    text: "B\xE0 ta kh\xF4ng ng\u1EE7. B\xE0 ta ch\u1EC9 ch\u1EDD."
    en: She doesn't sleep. She waits.
  - key: ui.warning_title
    text: "C\u1EA2NH B\xC1O"
    en: WARNING
  - key: ui.warning_body
    text: "Tr\xF2 ch\u01A1i ch\u1EE9a h\xECnh \u1EA3nh m\xE1u me, x\xE1c ch\u1EBFt,
      \xE2m thanh \u0111\u1ED9t ng\u1ED9t v\xE0 \xE1nh s\xE1ng nh\u1EA5p nh\xE1y.\nKh\xF4ng
      ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p v\u1EDBi ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\u01B0\u1EDBi 18 tu\u1ED5i, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      c\xF3 b\u1EC7nh tim ho\u1EB7c d\u1EC5 b\u1ECB k\xEDch \u0111\u1ED9ng.\n\nNh\u1EA5n
      ph\xEDm b\u1EA5t k\u1EF3 \u0111\u1EC3 ti\u1EBFp t\u1EE5c."
    en: 'This game contains graphic violence, gore, sudden loud sounds and flashing
      lights.

      Not suitable for players under 18, or anyone with a heart condition
      or photosensitivity.


      Press any key to continue.'
  - key: ui.calib_title
    text: "\u0110I\u1EC0U CH\u1EC8NH \u0110\u1ED8 S\xC1NG"
    en: BRIGHTNESS CALIBRATION
  - key: ui.calib_body
    text: "K\xE9o thanh tr\u01B0\u1EE3t cho t\u1EDBi khi h\xECnh b\xEAn tr\xE1i th\u1EA5y
      r\xF5, h\xECnh gi\u1EEFa th\u1EA5y m\u1EDD\nv\xE0 h\xECnh b\xEAn ph\u1EA3i
      G\u1EA6N NH\u01AF kh\xF4ng nh\xECn th\u1EA5y."
    en: 'Adjust until the left symbol is clearly visible, the middle one faint,

      and
      the right one BARELY visible.'
  - key: ui.credits_body
    text: "BLACKWOOD MANOR: THE SOUL-LOCK CURSE\n\nK\u1ECBch b\u1EA3n & thi\u1EBFt
      k\u1EBF: nh\xF3m d\u1EF1 \xE1n refactored-adventure\nL\u1EADp tr\xECnh, d\u1EF1ng
      c\u1EA3nh, \xE2m thanh t\u1ED5ng h\u1EE3p: Claude (Anthropic) c\xF9ng nh\xF3m\nT\xE0i
      nguy\xEAn: Flooded Grounds, Abandoned Asylum, Vintage Living Room, civilian_girl,
      Mixamo\nPh\xF4ng ch\u1EEF: Be Vietnam Pro, Noto Serif (SIL OFL)\n\nC\u1EA3m
      \u01A1n b\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 d\xE1m b\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xE0o dinh th\u1EF1 Blackwood."
    en: 'BLACKWOOD MANOR: THE SOUL-LOCK CURSE


      Story & design: the refactored-adventure
      team

      Programming, level building, synthesized audio: Claude (Anthropic)
      with the team

      Assets: Flooded Grounds, Abandoned Asylum, Vintage Living
      Room, civilian_girl, Mixamo

      Fonts: Be Vietnam Pro, Noto Serif (SIL OFL)


      Thank
      you for daring to enter Blackwood Manor.'
  - key: ui.tab.graphics
    text: "H\xECnh \u1EA3nh"
    en: Graphics
  - key: ui.tab.audio
    text: "\xC2m thanh"
    en: Audio
  - key: ui.tab.controls
    text: "\u0110i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n"
    en: Controls
  - key: ui.tab.display
    text: "Hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB"
    en: Display
  - key: ui.h.screen
    text: "M\xE0n h\xECnh"
    en: Screen
  - key: ui.h.quality
    text: "Ch\u1EA5t l\u01B0\u1EE3ng"
    en: Quality
  - key: ui.h.volume
    text: "\xC2m l\u01B0\u1EE3ng"
    en: Volume
  - key: ui.h.subtitles
    text: "Ph\u1EE5 \u0111\u1EC1"
    en: Subtitles
  - key: ui.h.mouse
    text: "Chu\u1ED9t"
    en: Mouse
  - key: ui.h.keys
    text: "Ph\xEDm \u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n"
    en: Key bindings
  - key: ui.h.brightness
    text: "\u0110\u1ED9 s\xE1ng"
    en: Brightness
  - key: ui.h.hud
    text: "Giao di\u1EC7n"
    en: Interface
  - key: ui.screen_mode
    text: "Ch\u1EBF \u0111\u1ED9 hi\u1EC3n th\u1ECB"
    en: Display mode
  - key: ui.fullscreen
    text: "To\xE0n m\xE0n h\xECnh"
    en: Fullscreen
  - key: ui.borderless
    text: "C\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 kh\xF4ng vi\u1EC1n"
    en: Borderless window
  - key: ui.windowed
    text: "C\u1EEDa s\u1ED5"
    en: Windowed
  - key: ui.resolution
    text: "\u0110\u1ED9 ph\xE2n gi\u1EA3i"
    en: Resolution
  - key: ui.vsync
    text: "\u0110\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9 d\u1ECDc (VSync)"
    en: VSync
  - key: ui.fps_cap
    text: "Gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n FPS"
    en: Frame rate limit
  - key: ui.unlimited
    text: "Kh\xF4ng gi\u1EDBi h\u1EA1n"
    en: Unlimited
  - key: ui.quality
    text: "Ch\u1EA5t l\u01B0\u1EE3ng \u0111\u1ED3 h\u1ECDa"
    en: Graphics quality
  - key: ui.fov
    text: "Tr\u01B0\u1EDDng nh\xECn (FOV)"
    en: Field of view
  - key: ui.motion_blur
    text: "L\xE0m m\u1EDD chuy\u1EC3n \u0111\u1ED9ng"
    en: Motion blur
  - key: ui.film_grain
    text: "Nhi\u1EC5u h\u1EA1t phim"
    en: Film grain
  - key: ui.vol_master
    text: "T\u1ED5ng"
    en: Master
  - key: ui.vol_music
    text: "Nh\u1EA1c"
    en: Music
  - key: ui.vol_sfx
    text: "Hi\u1EC7u \u1EE9ng"
    en: Effects
  - key: ui.vol_amb
    text: "M\xF4i tr\u01B0\u1EDDng"
    en: Ambience
  - key: ui.vol_voice
    text: "Gi\u1ECDng n\xF3i"
    en: Voice
  - key: ui.subtitles
    text: "Hi\u1EC7n ph\u1EE5 \u0111\u1EC1"
    en: Show subtitles
  - key: ui.headphones
    text: "\xC2m thanh 3D \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF cho tai nghe: ti\u1EBFng
      ch\xECa kh\xF3a cho bi\u1EBFt b\xE0 ta \u1EDF b\xEAn n\xE0o."
    en: '3D audio is designed for headphones: the jingle of keys tells you which
      side she''s on.'
  - key: ui.sensitivity
    text: "\u0110\u1ED9 nh\u1EA1y chu\u1ED9t"
    en: Mouse sensitivity
  - key: ui.brightness
    text: "\u0110\u1ED9 s\xE1ng"
    en: Brightness
  - key: ui.show_fps
    text: "Hi\u1EC7n FPS"
    en: Show FPS
  - key: ui.language
    text: "Ng\xF4n ng\u1EEF"
    en: Language
  - key: ui.on
    text: "B\u1EADt"
    en: On
  - key: ui.off
    text: "T\u1EAFt"
    en: Off
  - key: ui.key.move
    text: "Di chuy\u1EC3n"
    en: Move
  - key: ui.key.run
    text: "Ch\u1EA1y"
    en: Sprint
  - key: ui.key.interact
    text: "T\u01B0\u01A1ng t\xE1c"
    en: Interact
  - key: ui.key.notebook
    text: "S\u1ED5 tay"
    en: Notebook
  - key: ui.key.hotbar
    text: "\u0110\u1ED5i v\u1EADt ph\u1EA9m"
    en: Switch item
  - key: ui.key.use
    text: "D\xF9ng v\u1EADt ph\u1EA9m"
    en: Use item
  - key: ui.key.breath
    text: "N\xEDn th\u1EDF (khi tr\u1ED1n)"
    en: Hold breath (hiding)
  - key: ui.key.pause
    text: "T\u1EA1m d\u1EEBng"
    en: Pause
  - key: ui.you_died
    text: "B\u1EA0N \u0110\xC3 CH\u1EBET"
    en: YOU DIED
  - key: hud.battery
    text: PIN
    en: BATTERY
  - key: hud.film
    text: PHIM
    en: FILM
  - key: item.recorder
    text: "M\xE1y ghi \xE2m"
    en: Cassette Recorder
  - key: item.film_camera
    text: "M\xE1y \u1EA3nh film"
    en: Film Camera
  - key: item.crowbar
    text: "X\xE0 beng"
    en: Crowbar
  - key: item.phone
    text: "\u0110i\u1EC7n tho\u1EA1i"
    en: Smartphone
  - key: item.night_vision
    text: "K\xEDnh nh\xECn \u0111\xEAm"
    en: Night Vision
  - key: year.present
    text: "Hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i"
    en: Present
  - key: char.choose
    text: "CH\u1ECCN NH\xC2N V\u1EACT"
    en: CHOOSE YOUR INVESTIGATOR
  - key: char.evelyn.name
    text: Evelyn Reid
    en: Evelyn Reid
  - key: char.evelyn.role
    text: "Nh\xE0 b\xE1o \u0111i\u1EC1u tra \xB7 The Ashford Herald"
    en: "Investigative Journalist \xB7 The Ashford Herald"
  - key: char.evelyn.motive
    text: "G\u1EA7n m\u1ED9t th\u1EBF k\u1EF7 \xE1n m\u1EA1ng b\u1ECB ni\xEAm phong.
      C\u1ED9ng s\u1EF1 c\u1EE7a c\xF4, Julian Vance, \u0111\xE3 m\u1EA5t li\xEAn
      l\u1EA1c ngay sau khi g\u1EEDi v\u1EC1 m\u1ED9t b\u1EE9c \u1EA3nh m\u1EADt
      m\xE3."
    en: Nearly a century of sealed murder files. Her partner, Julian Vance, went
      silent right after sending back a coded photograph.
  - key: char.evelyn.tools
    text: "S\u1ED5 tay trinh th\xE1m t\u1EF1 x\xE2u chu\u1ED7i manh m\u1ED1i \xB7
      M\xE1y ghi \xE2m b\u1EAFt ti\u1EBFng EVP \u0111\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ECBnh h\u01B0\u1EDBng
      k\u1EBB s\u0103n \u0111u\u1ED5i \xB7 M\xE1y \u1EA3nh film c\xF3 \u0111\xE8n
      flash"
    en: "A detective notebook that links the evidence \xB7 A cassette recorder that
      catches EVP and tracks the hunter \xB7 A film camera with flash"
  - key: char.alex.name
    text: Alex Vance
    en: Alex Vance
  - key: char.alex.role
    text: "Streamer t\xE2m linh \xB7 k\xEAnh VanceAfterDark"
    en: "Paranormal Streamer \xB7 VanceAfterDark"
  - key: char.alex.motive
    text: "K\xEAnh livestream \u0111ang l\u1EE5i t\xE0n. Em trai anh, k\u1EF9 thu\u1EADt
      vi\xEAn Julian, bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t trong dinh th\u1EF1 14 ng\xE0y tr\u01B0\u1EDBc.
      \u0110\xEAm nay anh l\xEAn s\xF3ng, v\xE0 \u0111i t\xECm n\xF3."
    en: "The channel is dying. His little brother Julian, a sound tech, vanished
      in the manor 14 days ago. Tonight Alex goes live \u2014 and goes looking for
      him."
  - key: char.alex.tools
    text: "\u0110i\u1EC7n tho\u1EA1i livestream v\u1EDBi khung chat tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp
      \xB7 K\xEDnh nh\xECn \u0111\xEAm soi d\u1EA5u v\u1EBFt \u1EA9n \xB7 \u0110\xE8n
      flash \u0111i\u1EC7n tho\u1EA1i"
    en: "A livestreaming phone with live chat \xB7 Night vision that reveals hidden
      traces \xB7 Phone flash"
  - key: char.start
    text: "B\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u"
    en: Begin
  - key: intro.evelyn.1
    text: "H\u1ED3 s\u01A1 Blackwood: 1924, 1953, 1978, 1996, 2009. M\u01B0\u1EDDi
      ba n\u0103m m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n, c\xF3 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u1EBFt trong ng\xF4i
      nh\xE0 n\xE0y."
    en: 'The Blackwood files: 1924, 1953, 1978, 1996, 2009. Every generation, someone
      dies in that house.'
  - key: intro.evelyn.2
    text: "M\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1ED1n ng\xE0y tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, Julian g\u1EEDi cho t\xF4i
      m\u1ED9t b\u1EE9c \u1EA3nh ch\u1EE5p s\xE0n nh\xE0 b\u1EBFp. R\u1ED3i im l\u1EB7ng."
    en: Fourteen days ago, Julian sent me a photograph of the kitchen floor. Then
      nothing.
  - key: intro.evelyn.3
    text: "T\xF2a so\u1EA1n b\u1EA3o t\xF4i b\u1ECF \u0111i. T\xF4i l\xE1i xe \u0111\u1EBFn
      Blackwood l\xFAc n\u1EEDa \u0111\xEAm."
    en: The paper told me to drop it. I drove to Blackwood at midnight.
  - key: intro.alex.1
    text: "Ba tr\u0103m ng\u01B0\u1EDDi xem. Tu\u1EA7n tr\u01B0\u1EDBc c\xF2n ba
      ngh\xECn."
    en: Three hundred viewers. Last week it was three thousand.
  - key: intro.alex.2
    text: "Julian b\u1EA3o n\xF3 t\xECm \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c th\u1EE9 s\u1EBD c\u1EE9u
      c\xE1i k\xEAnh n\xE0y. \u0110\xF3 l\xE0 tin nh\u1EAFn cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng c\u1EE7a
      n\xF3."
    en: Julian said he'd found something that would save the channel. That was his
      last message.
  - key: intro.alex.3
    text: "\u0110\xEAm nay t\xF4i l\xEAn s\xF3ng \u1EDF dinh th\u1EF1 Blackwood.
      V\xE0 t\xF4i s\u1EBD \u0111\u01B0a em t\xF4i v\u1EC1."
    en: Tonight I go live from Blackwood Manor. And I'm bringing my brother home.
  - key: ui.keyname.hotbar
    text: "1 \u2013 4 \xB7 cu\u1ED9n chu\u1ED9t"
    en: "1 \u2013 4 \xB7 mouse wheel"
  - key: ui.keyname.lmb
    text: "Chu\u1ED9t tr\xE1i"
    en: Left mouse
  - key: ui.keyname.hold_space
    text: "Gi\u1EEF Space"
    en: Hold Space
  - key: lord.1
    text: "\xC0\u2026 v\u1ECB kh\xE1ch th\u1EE9 m\u01B0\u1EDDi b\u1ED1n. M\u1EDDi
      ng\u1ED3i. \u0110\u1EEBng \u0111\u1EC3 \xFD nh\u1EEFng b\u1ED9 x\u01B0\u01A1ng
      \u2014 h\u1ECD l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi nh\xE0 c\u1EA3 th\xF4i."
    en: "Ah\u2026 the fourteenth guest. Do sit. Pay no mind to the bones \u2014 they're
      family, after all."
  - key: lord.2
    text: "C\u1EADu Julian c\u1EE7a c\xF4 \u0111\xE3 \u0111i xa h\u01A1n b\u1EA5t
      k\u1EF3 ai. Nh\u01B0ng c\u1EADu \u1EA5y t\u1EEB ch\u1ED1i m\xF3n qu\xE0 c\u1EE7a
      ta. Th\u1EADt ph\xED ph\u1EA1m."
    en: Your Julian came further than anyone. But he refused my gift. Such a waste.
  - key: lord.3
    text: "Nh\u1ECF m\u1ED9t gi\u1ECDt m\xE1u l\xEAn C\u1ED5 V\u1EADt, \u0111\u1ECDc
      ng\u01B0\u1EE3c b\xE0i ch\xFA th\u1EE9 n\u0103m. M\u01B0\u1EDDi ba linh h\u1ED3n
      s\u1EBD qu\u1EF3 d\u01B0\u1EDBi ch\xE2n c\xF4. M\xE3i m\xE3i."
    en: One drop of blood upon the Relic. Read the fifth verse backwards. Thirteen
      souls will kneel at your feet. Forever.
  - key: lord.4
    text: "Hay c\xF4 \u0111\u1ECBnh \u0111\u1EADp v\u1EE1 n\xF3? Ng\xF4i nh\xE0 s\u1EBD
      s\u1EADp. C\xF4 s\u1EBD ch\u1EB3ng c\xF2n g\xEC \u2014 k\u1EC3 c\u1EA3 c\u1EADu
      ta."
    en: "Or will you break it? The house will fall. You'll have nothing \u2014 not
      even him."
  - key: lord.choice.burn
    text: "N\xE9m k\u1EF7 v\u1EADt v\xE0o v\u1EA1c, \u0111\u1EADp n\xE1t C\u1ED5
      V\u1EADt"
    en: Cast the relics into the cauldron and shatter the Relic
  - key: lord.choice.blood
    text: "Nh\u1ECF m\xE1u l\xEAn C\u1ED5 V\u1EADt, \u0111\u1ECDc ng\u01B0\u1EE3c
      b\xE0i ch\xFA"
    en: Bleed upon the Relic and read the verse backwards
  - key: julian.carving
    text: "\"Lord Blackwood kh\xF4ng bao gi\u1EDD ch\u1EBFt. L\xE3o s\u1ED1ng b\u1EB1ng
      ch\xEDnh l\xF2ng tham c\u1EE7a k\u1EBB k\u1EBF t\u1EE5c. \u0110\u1EEBng \u0111\u1EC3
      l\xE3o g\u1EA1t\u2026\""
    en: "\"Lord Blackwood never dies. He lives on the greed of whoever comes next.
      Don't let him fool you\u2026\""
  - key: end.1.title
    text: "K\u1EBET TH\xDAC I \u2014 GI\u1EA2I THO\xC1T"
    en: "ENDING I \u2014 RELEASE"
  - key: end.1.body
    text: "M\u01B0\u1EDDi ba s\u1EE3i x\xEDch linh h\u1ED3n \u0111\u1EE9t tung. Lord
      Blackwood tan th\xE0nh tro b\u1EE5i. Mrs. Peake m\u1EC9m c\u01B0\u1EDDi, l\u1EA7n
      \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn sau m\u1ED9t tr\u0103m n\u0103m. Julian \xF4m b\u1EA1n
      m\u1ED9t l\u1EA7n cu\u1ED1i r\u1ED3i tan v\xE0o \xE1nh s\xE1ng.\n\nDinh th\u1EF1
      s\u1EE5p \u0111\u1ED5 sau l\u01B0ng. B\u1EA1n ch\u1EA1y ra \u0111\xFAng l\xFAc
      b\xECnh minh. Trong t\xFAi \xE1o v\u1EABn c\xF2n chi\u1EBFc c\xF2i nh\u1ECF
      c\u1EE7a Julian."
    en: "Thirteen soul-chains snap at once. Lord Blackwood crumbles to ash. Mrs.
      Peake smiles \u2014 for the first time in a hundred years. Julian holds you
      one last time, then fades into the light.\n\nThe manor collapses behind you.
      You stumble out as the sun rises. In your pocket, Julian's little whistle."
  - key: end.2.title
    text: "K\u1EBET TH\xDAC II \u2014 T\xC2N CH\u1EE6 NH\xC2N"
    en: "ENDING II \u2014 THE NEW MASTER"
  - key: end.2.body
    text: "M\u01B0\u1EDDi ba oan h\u1ED3n qu\u1EF3 ph\u1EE5c d\u01B0\u1EDBi ch\xE2n
      b\u1EA1n. Lord Blackwood b\u1ECB h\xFAt v\xE0o C\u1ED5 V\u1EADt l\xE0m n\xF4
      l\u1EC7. Julian b\u1ECB tr\xF3i trong \u0111\xF3, v\u0129nh vi\u1EC5n.\n\nV\xE0i
      th\xE1ng sau, m\u1ED9t nh\xF3m b\u1EA1n tr\u1EBB d\u1EEBng xe tr\u01B0\u1EDBc
      c\u1ED5ng. Tr\xEAn c\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 t\u1EA7ng hai, m\u1ED9t b\xF3ng ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      m\u1EC9m c\u01B0\u1EDDi.\n\n\"V\xE0o \u0111i\u2026 nh\xE0 \u0111ang \u0111\u1EE3i
      c\xE1c b\u1EA1n.\""
    en: "Thirteen souls kneel before you. Lord Blackwood is dragged into the Relic
      as your slave. Julian is bound inside it \u2014 forever.\n\nMonths later, a
      carload of friends pulls up at the gate. In a second-floor window, a figure
      smiles.\n\n\"Come in\u2026 the house has been waiting for you.\""
  - key: end.3.title
    text: "K\u1EBET TH\xDAC B\xCD M\u1EACT \u2014 K\u1EBA H\xC8N NH\xC1T"
    en: "SECRET ENDING \u2014 THE COWARD"
  - key: end.3.body
    text: "Hai gi\u1EDD s\xE1ng. \u0110\u01B0\u1EDDng l\u1ED9 tr\u1ED1ng tr\u01A1n.
      B\u1EA1n \u0111\xE3 tho\xE1t.\n\nNh\u01B0ng m\u1ED7i l\u1EA7n li\u1EBFc g\u01B0\u01A1ng
      chi\u1EBFu h\u1EADu, lu\xF4n c\xF3 m\u1ED9t ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE0n b\xE0
      m\u1EB7c \u0111\u1ED3 qu\u1EA3n gia m\xE0u \u0111en ng\u1ED3i b\u1EA5t \u0111\u1ED9ng
      \u1EDF gh\u1EBF sau.\n\nB\u1EC7nh vi\u1EC7n t\xE2m th\u1EA7n Ashford, ph\xF2ng
      13. B\u1EC7nh nh\xE2n c\xE0o l\xEAn t\u01B0\u1EDDng c\xF9ng m\u1ED9t h\xECnh
      th\xF9, \u0111\xEAm n\xE0y qua \u0111\xEAm kh\xE1c."
    en: 'Two in the morning. The road is empty. You got away.


      But every time
      you glance in the rear-view mirror, a woman in a black housekeeper''s dress
      sits perfectly still in the back seat.


      Ashford Asylum, Room 13. The
      patient scratches the same shape into the wall, night after night.'
  - key: end.stats
    text: "Th\u1EDDi gian ch\u01A1i: {0}  \xB7  S\u1ED1 l\u1EA7n ch\u1EBFt: {1} 
      \xB7  T\xE0i li\u1EC7u: {2}"
    en: "Play time: {0}  \xB7  Deaths: {1}  \xB7  Documents: {2}"
  - key: end.continue
    text: "Nh\u1EA5n ph\xEDm b\u1EA5t k\u1EF3"
    en: Press any key
  - key: ui.q.low
    text: "Th\u1EA5p"
    en: Low
  - key: ui.q.medium
    text: "Trung b\xECnh"
    en: Medium
  - key: ui.q.high
    text: Cao
    en: High
  - key: ui.q.ultra
    text: "Si\xEAu cao"
    en: Ultra
  - key: prompt.safe
    text: "[E] Xoay m\xE3 k\xE9t s\u1EAFt"
    en: '[E] Try the safe''s combination'
  - key: prompt.safe_take
    text: "[E] L\u1EA5y \u0111\u1ED3 trong k\xE9t"
    en: '[E] Take what''s inside'
  - key: safe.title
    text: "K\xC9T S\u1EAET BLACKWOOD"
    en: BLACKWOOD SAFE
  - key: safe.hint
    text: "A/D ch\u1ECDn v\xF2ng \xB7 W/S ho\u1EB7c cu\u1ED9n chu\u1ED9t \u0111\u1ED5i
      s\u1ED1 \xB7 g\xF5 s\u1ED1 tr\u1EF1c ti\u1EBFp \xB7 Enter th\u1EED \xB7 Esc
      \u0111\xF3ng"
    en: "A/D select dial \xB7 W/S or mouse wheel change digit \xB7 type digits \xB7
      Enter try \xB7 Esc close"
  - key: safe.wrong
    text: "Ch\u1ED1t kh\xF4ng nh\xFAc nh\xEDch."
    en: The bolt doesn't move.
  - key: safe.wrong_hint
    text: "Kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i n\u0103m x\xE2y xong\u2026 m\xE0 l\xE0 n\u0103m c\u01A1
      nghi\u1EC7p n\xE0y b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u."
    en: "Not the year it was finished\u2026 the year this fortune began."
  - key: safe.opened
    text: "(Ch\u1ED1t th\xE9p b\u1EADt ra. C\u1EEDa k\xE9t n\u1EB7ng n\u1EC1 h\xE9
      m\u1EDF.)"
    en: (The steel bolt snaps back. The heavy door swings open.)
  - key: prompt.stand
    text: "[E] B\u1EC7 n\u1EBFn \u2014 bia kh\u1EAFc: {0}"
    en: "[E] Candle stand \u2014 plaque: {0}"
  - key: prompt.stand_lit
    text: "Ng\u1ECDn n\u1EBFn \u0111\xE3 ch\xE1y \u2014 {0}"
    en: "The candle burns \u2014 {0}"
  - key: plaque.moc
    text: "Annabelle Blackwood \xB7 1916\u20131924"
    en: "Annabelle Blackwood \xB7 1916\u20131924"
  - key: plaque.thuy
    text: "V\u1ECB kh\xE1ch kh\xF4ng t\xEAn \xB7 1924"
    en: "The Nameless Guest \xB7 1924"
  - key: plaque.tho
    text: "Eleanor Peake \xB7 1879\u20131924"
    en: "Eleanor Peake \xB7 1879\u20131924"
  - key: plaque.kim
    text: "Thomas Hale \xB7 1881\u20131924"
    en: "Thomas Hale \xB7 1881\u20131924"
  - key: plaque.hoa
    text: "Isabella Blackwood \xB7 1895\u20131924"
    en: "Isabella Blackwood \xB7 1895\u20131924"
  - key: altar.no_pages
    text: "B\u1EC7 n\u1EBFn d\u01B0\u1EDBi bia \"{0}\" c\xF2n tr\u1ED1ng. C\u1EA7n
      m\u1ED9t trang Vademecum."
    en: The stand beneath "{0}" is empty. It needs a page of the Vademecum.
  - key: altar.choose
    text: "\u0110\u1EB7t trang n\xE0o l\xEAn b\u1EC7 c\u1EE7a\n{0}?"
    en: 'Which page belongs to

      {0}?'
  - key: altar.hint
    text: "M\u1ED7i t\u1EA5m bia l\xE0 m\u1ED9t M\u1EAFt Tr\u1EADn. \u0110\u1ECDc
      l\u1EA1i k\u1EF7 v\u1EADt trong S\u1ED5 tay n\u1EBFu ch\u01B0a ch\u1EAFc. \xB7
      Esc \u0111\u1EC3 h\u1EE7y"
    en: "Each plaque names an Eye of the circle. Re-read the relics in your notebook
      if unsure. \xB7 Esc to cancel"
  - key: altar.correct
    text: "(Ng\u1ECDn n\u1EBFn t\u1EF1 b\xF9ng ch\xE1y. {0}/5)"
    en: (The candle flares to life by itself. {0}/5)
  - key: altar.wrong
    text: "(Ng\u1ECDn n\u1EBFn ph\u1EE5t t\u1EAFt. Trang gi\u1EA5y n\xF3ng r\u1EF1c
      tr\xEAn tay. C\xF3 th\u1EE9 g\xEC \u0111\xF3 \u0111\xE3 nghe th\u1EA5y.)"
    en: (The flame gutters out. The page burns hot in your hand. Something heard
      that.)
  - key: altar.rumble
    text: "(C\u1EA3 dinh th\u1EF1 rung chuy\u1EC3n\u2026)"
    en: "(The whole manor shudders\u2026)"
  - key: altar.opened
    text: "(D\u01B0\u1EDBi nh\xE0 b\u1EBFp v\u1ECDng l\xEAn ti\u1EBFng x\xEDch s\u1EAFt
      \u0111\u1EE9t tung. N\u1EAFp h\u1EA7m \u0111\xE3 m\u1EDF.)"
    en: (From the kitchen below comes the scream of snapping chains. The cellar is
      open.)
  - key: tape.playing
    text: "\u0110ang ph\xE1t: {0}"
    en: 'Playing: {0}'
  - key: tape.speaker
    text: Julian
    en: Julian
  - key: prompt.window_pry
    text: "[E] N\u1EA1y c\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 b\u1EB1ng x\xE0 beng"
    en: '[E] Pry the window open with the crowbar'
  - key: prompt.window_nailed
    text: "[E] C\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 b\u1ECB \u0111\xF3ng \u0111inh"
    en: '[E] The window is nailed shut'
  - key: msg.window_nailed
    text: "V\xE1n g\u1ED7 \u0111\xF3ng \u0111inh ch\u1EB7t. C\u1EA7n th\u1EE9 g\xEC
      \u0111\xF3 \u0111\u1EC3 n\u1EA1y."
    en: The boards are nailed tight. You'd need something to pry them.
  - key: ui.confirm_flee
    text: "N\u1EA1y c\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 v\xE0 b\u1ECF ch\u1EA1y?\nJulian v\u1EABn c\xF2n
      \u1EDF \u0111\xE2u \u0111\xF3 trong ng\xF4i nh\xE0 n\xE0y."
    en: 'Pry the window and run?

      Julian is still somewhere in this house.'
